WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.1 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
From work to structure

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Structure follows the work: list the functions your strategy needs before naming any roles.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. List capabilities from your objectives and Theory of Change.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Mark each function in-house, shared or contracted.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Spot where one founder holds too much, before you launch.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You list your functions and how each will be resourced at the start.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
